  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving country data for monitoring SDG achievements and informing policy decision</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of this Programme is to develop the capacities of the national institutions responsible for collecting, computing and disseminating the SDG data and indicators, so as to ensure that countries are able to report SDG indicators both for national and global monitoring and to use them for policy analysis and policy formulation.</narrative>
